      "writtenOn": "2024-08-07T13:35:12Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "You mean, we don\u0027t need to startPollingForConnector again. \n\nJust checking the binder is alive or not, should be sufficient?\n\nin this function, if binder is dead, then should add consumer to queue and return?",
      "parentUuid": "d2a1512c_326c4146",
      "revId": "a2bf70e8631cbc127aba6259d07d9e9d6ad29f53",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
